---
import Pagina from '../../layouts/Pagina.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../../site.config.mjs';
import { u } from '../../lib/util';
---

<Pagina titulo="About" descricao={`What ${SITE.nome} is, who runs it and how the site pays for itself.`} alternativa={{ pt: u('/sobre/') }}>
  <p>
    {SITE.nome} is an independent fan site with a single topic: GTA 6 cheats, easter eggs, secrets and tips, written plainly and without filler.
    It started in Brazilian Portuguese, and this English edition covers the same finds for English-speaking players.
  </p>
  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>
    GTA 6 discoveries are spread across hundreds of videos, streams and articles. We pull them into one place, show exactly where each one came
    from, and keep what has been confirmed separate from what only one source has shown so far.
  </p>
  <h2>How the site pays for itself</h2>
  <p>
    The site is free and supported by ads. Ads are labeled and never decide what we publish. If we ever use affiliate links, they will be marked.
  </p>
  <h2>Not affiliated with Rockstar</h2>
  <p>
    This is a fan site. We have no connection to Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive. Grand Theft Auto, GTA and the names in the game are
    trademarks of their owners.
  </p>
  <p>See also <a href={u('/en/how-we-verify/')}>how we verify each tip</a>.</p>
</Pagina>
